4. Execution Results

The actual results and statuses will be updated after each test case is executed.

|   Status   |   Meaning   |
|---|---|
| Not Executed | The test has not yet been performed. |
| Pass | Actual behavior matches the expected result. |
| Fail | Actual behavior does not match the expected result. |
| Blocked | The test cannot be completed due to an issue or dependency. |

5. Notes

- Test cases must be executed against the live demo application.
- Actual results must reflect observed behavior.
- Defects must be documented separately in the Bug Reports document.
- Any changes to the test scope should be recorded in the Test Plan.
